# Visual FoxPro IF syntax

Visual FoxPro does **not** support `ELSEIF`, `ElseIf`, `ELSIF`, `Elsif`, or `ELSE IF`.

## Valid pattern

```foxpro
IF <logical_condition>
   ...
ELSE
   ...
ENDIF
```

## Multiple branches

Use nested `IF` inside `ELSE`:

```foxpro
IF <condition_1>
   ...
ELSE
   IF <condition_2>
      ...
   ELSE
      ...
   ENDIF
ENDIF
```

## When editing or generating `.prg` code

- Never emit `ELSEIF` / `ELSIF` variants.
- Before finishing, search the changed files for `Elseif|Elsif|ELSEIF|ELSIF` and fix any match.
